Legends Mod Core Animation Assets — Credit & License Notice
===========================================================

Files in this folder (`player.json` and `katana.json`) are ported from
Legends Mod Core (`Legends-1.20.1-ss1.0.25.jar`, Modrinth project `TfKZ50GD`,
version `kCUYqPqz`):

- `player.json`: ported from `assets/legendsmod/legends_animations/player.animation.json`
- `katana.json`: ported from `assets/legendsmod/animations/item/katana.animation.json`

Also derived from it, outside this folder:

- `../katana_forms.json`: its item (`right_item`) tracks are retimed from `katana.json`;
  its arm and torso tracks are not from `katana.json` (which animates only the blade).

